    "BrochureContent": [
      {
        "ContentType": "Description",
        "SortOrder": 0,
        "Content": "MOVEHOME ESTATE AGENTS... are proud to present an attractive and light-filled large two-bedroom 2 bathroom apartment, ideally located within the superb Spencer Dock development in the heart of Dublin’s Docklands that spans over 93 m² / 1,001 ft² with generous proportions throughout. No. 52 Cloncurry House is one of the largest apartments in the development and is complemented by an excellent dual-aspect layout, with another balcony to the rear enjoying the morning easterly sunrise and access is enjoyed from the two rear double rooms. This luxurious apartment is a home of real distinction, combining immense modern character with classic contemporary style and all the comforts and conveniences of modern living.\r\n\r\nThe accommodation comprises a spacious hall that gives an immediate impression of the generous proportions in No. 51. The open-plan living & dining area enjoys high ceilings and the wall of glass enjoys a westerly orientation and floods the room with natural light throughout the day. Off the rear dinig area is the a fully fitted kitchen with all intergrated appliances and a tiled floor. The long feature hallway leads down to the large main bathroom, then onto the two rear double rooms. The master bedroom enjoys the most space and an ensuite bathroom and ample wardrobe space compliments the sapcious dream bedroom. The property benefits from excellent outdoor space, including two large balconies overlooking the beautifully landscaped communal gardens to the rear and towards the River Liffey and canal to the front. The apartment also features an energy-efficient gas heating system and one designated underground parking space. Residents of Spencer Dock enjoy a range of premium amenities, including a concierge service operating seven days a week, beautifully maintained communal gardens with water features and excellent transport connectivity, including the dedicated Spencer Dock Luas stop.\r\n\r\nThe IFSC is one of Dublins most central locations and the apartment is also exceptionally well served by public transport, with the LUAS, Dublin Bus and Connolly Station all within easy reach, providing convenient access throughout the city and beyond. The property’s central location makes it particularly appealing to working within the IFSC, Docklands and Dublin city centre, while its proximity to Trinity College, Grand Canal Square and the wider city centre further enhances its appeal.\r\n\r\nIdeally positioned in the heart of the Docklands, the development is within easy walking distance of an extensive selection of restaurants, cafés, shops, leisure facilities and major employers, while Dublin city centre and the IFSC are also readily accessible.\r\nDesigned by renowned architects Scott Tallon Walker, Spencer Dock combines striking contemporary architecture with a high standard of residential living. With its spacious duplex accommodation, excellent natural light, private outdoor space, river views, secure parking and superb location, Apartment 52 represents an excellent opportunity to acquire a quality home in one of Dublin’s most sought-after residential locations.\r\n\r\nEarly viewing is essential to appreciate all this luxurious apartment has to offer and by appointment with MOVEHOME ESTATE AGENTS ... 01-88 44 690"
      },
